        verbatim: "TESTICULAR ATROPHY is not uncommon in aging men or following\nan episode of mumps. Testicular atrophy may result in decreased sexual\ndrive and feminization.\nTreatment of testicular atrophy should include zinc at 20 mg t.i.d., plant\nderived colloidal minerals, an herbal combination mixed with testosterone\n(Zumbani), ginseng (Panax ginseng), and saw palmetto (Serenoa serrulata).",
