        verbatim: "Celiac disease is, therefore, the basic cause of many diseases including\ndiabetes (i.e. malabsorption of chromium and vanadium), cancer (i.e.\nmalabsorption of zinc, vitamin A, and selenium), and muscular dystrophy\nand cystic fibrosis (i.e. malabsorption of selenium in the pregnant mother\nresulting in damage to the fetus).",
