        verbatim: "AN EXCESS OF\nMAGNESIUM WILL INHIBIT BONE CALCIFICATION. Calcium and\nMg have antagonistic roles in normal muscle contraction, calcium acting as\nthe stimulator and Mg as the relaxer. An excessive amount of Ca can induce\nsigns of Mg deficiency.",
