        verbatim: "The dolphins\u2019 diet consisted exclusively of frozen smelt. Smelt muscle\ntissue contains a significant amount of thiaminase enzyme that was more\nthan canceling out any thiamin the dolphin received from their daily\nvitamin supplement. While cooking deactivates the enzymes of raw meat,\nobviously dolphins don\u2019t cook their food.",
