        verbatim: "The nutritional awareness in humans during the sixties was focused on\nvitamins. Theron Randolph emphasized the relationship between niacin\n(B3) deficiency and schizophrenia. Linus Pauling promoted\nvitamin C for preventing cancer. Vitamin E was touted for people\u2019s sex life\nand longevity.",
