        verbatim: "ECCHYMOSIS (easy bruising) is very common, especially in women and\nchildren on low fiber, low fruit, and low vegetable diets (i.e. fast foods, lots\nof coffee, tea, and soft drinks).\nTreatment includes alfalfa tablets at 4-6 b.i.d., vitamin C to bowel tolerance,\nvitamin K at 15 mg/day, vitamin E at 800-1,200 IU/day, and 4-6 cups of\ngreen vegetables each day.",
