        verbatim: "Addison\u2019s\nDisease, a loss of function of the adrenal cortex,\nresults in the loss of Na and K retention with clinical signs of general\nweakness, muscle cramps, weight loss, and a marked \u201Csalt hunger.\u201D The\nsymptoms can be relieved with the supplementation of NaCl or by\nadministering adrenal cortical hormones.",
