        verbatim: "The balance of P in the human body is found as biologically active intra and\nextracellular colloidal P in combination with carbohydrates, lipids, protein,\nand a wide variety of other biologically active organic compounds including\nthe blood\u2019s major buffer system. B-complex vitamins function as\ncoenzymes to intracellular metabolic functions only when combined with\nphosphorus.",
