        verbatim: "I was honored and humbled by the nomination. The fact that peers and\ncolleagues held my work in such high regard was the pinnacle of my\nscientific career. The nomination for the Nobel Prize in Medicine, however,\nonly created a jealous rage from many medical doctors and fellow doctors\nof alternative medicine in later years. After all, who was Wallach, and how\ncould such a maverick deserve such a hallowed and coveted nomination?",
