        question: "How was vitamin D discovered to cure rickets?",
        answer_short: "Early 20th-century researchers proved both sunlight and diet cured rickets \u2014 Hulschinsky straightened deformed limbs with UV lamps, and Mellanby and McCollum showed cod liver oil cured it even after its vitamin A was destroyed.",
