        verbatim: "A deficiency syndrome for pyridoxine has been\nidentified in mentally retarded children that also have\nconvulsions due to an inborn error of B, metabolism. It is\nthought that these children are unable to synthesize GABA;\ncorrection of this syndrome requires daily ingestion of large\namounts of B, to prevent permanent retardation.",
