        verbatim: "Folacin or folic acid was identified as one of many\ngrowth factors in bacteria and laboratory animals and in\nthe prevention and treatment of anemia. It was synthesized\nin 1946 and quickly established as an essential nutrient for\nhumans.\n\nFolic acid deficiencies may be the most common",
