        verbatim: "Man can synthesize choline from the amino acids methionine\nor serine in the presence of vitamin B,, and folacin. The rate at\nwhich choline can be synthesized is insufficient to meet daily\nrequirements and for this reason it is considered an essential\nnutrient.",
