        verbatim: "Lithium carbonate is regularly used to treat patients\nwith the severe form of bipolar disorder. More than 3 million\nprescriptions for this trace mineral are filled yearly. The role of\nlithium is thought to be related to the role the brain cells play\nand respond to certain hormones and neurotransmitters.",
