        verbatim: "Nitrates and nitrites are added to canned foods and\npreserved meats to help prevent the growth of bacteria and to\ncolor meat red.\n\nNitrates and nitrites are converted to nitrosamines in\nthe acid environment of the stomach; these compounds can\nbe converted to cancer causing chemicals (carcinogens) and\ncan suppress thyroid function.",
