        verbatim: "BEDSORES: result from pressure of body\nweight in areas of poor circulation - usually in\nareas of bony prominences. Massage, sponge\nbaths and ultra violet light are good preventive\ntherapies. Topical applications can include\nzinc oxide ointment, aloe vera ointment, vitamin E oil and DMSO; eucalyptus (Eucalyptus\nglobulus), wild carrot, (Daucus carota)and\ncomfrey (Symphytum officinale) may all be\nused topically and/or in poultices to encourage granulation tissue formation and healing",
