        verbatim: "The treatment for colic in adults includes the\nbase line supplement program, betaine hydrochloride and pancreatic enzymes at 75-200\nmg each t.i.d. 15 minutes before meals, pulse\ntesting to determine presence of food allergies. In babies, pulse testing and diet diaries to\ndetermine offending foods, pancreatic enzymes at 75-200 mg t.i.d. before meals (enzymes may be constipating), one to two drops\nof flaxseed oil after each meal and B-6 at 10 mg\nb.i.d",
