        answer_short: "Wallach says starvation backfires, so eat at least 1,000 calories a day with moderate exercise; he says empty-calorie diets trigger pica-driven bingeing, so he adds colloidal minerals, tests for food allergies and hypoglycemia, and uses salmon and flaxseed oil, fiber, glucomannan, digestive enzymes, and thyroid.",
