        verbatim: "Table 7-8. Common Degenerative Diseases of Humans and Their Cause.\nOsteoporosis: Ca, Mg, B, Cu, S\nArthritis (Ankylosing spondylitis): Ca, Mg, B, Cu, S\nHypertension: Ca, Mg, B\nBone spurs, heel spurs, Ca deposits: Ca, Mg, B\nCancer: Se\nDiabetes: Cr, Va, Zn\nAneurysms: Cu\nCardiomyopathy: Se\nCataracts: Se\nDeafness: Sn",
