        verbatim: "Today, salt consumption, although contrary\nto popular belief, is not in and of itself harm-\nful; it does present the problem of allowing\nour bodies to think we are getting minerals\n(the equivalent of the \u201Cempty calorie diets\u201D,\ni.e.- processed food calories without vita-\nmins).",
